- C+E: {1,3,4} XOR {2,5} = {1,2,3,4,5} ✓ MATCH!
- D+E: {4,5} XOR {2,5} = {2,4} (bit 5 toggled twice, removed) ≠ {1,2,3,4,5}

So C+E gives exactly {1,2,3,4,5}.

